 "comments": [
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "Free for all with respawns. 5 seconds into each round a random player becomes the Juggernaut (the Juggernaut variable starts each round empty, so last round's can't be crowned twice).",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 4
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 341
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "Whoever kills the Juggernaut becomes it and scores 2 more. If the Juggernaut died some other way, a random player gets it. Everyone comes back after 3 seconds.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 410
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3778,
    "h": 751
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "20 points (kills, and 2 more for killing the Juggernaut) win the round, once: Round Over stops kills in the last seconds from ending it again. Scores start again next round.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1719
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3778,
    "h": 587
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "Bots go after the Juggernaut: every 5 seconds each other bot gets a goal at the place the Juggernaut is now (Bots: Goal, go and hold there). A bot in a fight keeps fighting, so in a crowded free for all this mostly moves the ones with nobody to shoot. Bot Follow would not do: it only follows teammates, and here everyone is an enemy.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1225
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 408
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "text": "Make Juggernaut: lots of health, slower, a machine gun and a red glow, and everyone is told.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2318
   },
   "size": {
